Question 12
Rewrite the following nested if-else code into an equivalent `switch-case` statement:
```java
int code = Integer.parseInt(jTextFieldCourse.getText());
String courseName = "";
if (code == 101)
    courseName = "Java Programming";
else if (code == 102)
    courseName = "MySQL Database";
else if (code == 103)
    courseName = "Web Development";
else if (code == 104)
    courseName = "Cyber Security";
else
    courseName = "General IT";
```

questions.answer:
**Model Solution:**
```java
int code = Integer.parseInt(jTextFieldCourse.getText());
String courseName = "";
switch (code) {
    case 101:
        courseName = "Java Programming";
        break;
    case 102:
        courseName = "MySQL Database";
        break;
    case 103:
        courseName = "Web Development";
        break;
    case 104:
        courseName = "Cyber Security";
        break;
    default:
        courseName = "General IT";
        break;
}
```

